--- !u!114 &1618477836
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1618477830}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 245d4604dd40eb04884cd41f035738a8, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNPC
  dialogueBox: {fileID: 390862392}
  textComp: {fileID: 1502800478}
  lines:
  - 'Maia: Hey I mean you no harm, sorry for sneaking up on you.'
  - 'Ginevra: (turns herself rapidly in direction of Maia, pointing a gun)

    How
    did you manage to get inside here?'
  - 'Maia: I followed the path through the trees...'
  - 'Ginevra: (Interrupts)

    I mean inside this fucking place not this pond. '
  - 'Maia: (Gets uncomfortable)

    (sigh) I was looking... for scrap and I found
    this old Humanite site, activated some IA system and got thrown inside this hellhole. '
  - 'Maia: Look I really just want to understand what''s this place and how to get
    out, I already saw the fucked up stuff happening here.'
  - 'Ginevra: And you still haven''t seen shit '
  - ...
  - 'Maia: Your name?'
  - 'Ginevra: Ginevra'
  - 'Maia: Maia. What happened here?'
  - 'Ginevra: The village or the Abyss? Either way nothing that so called gods should
    let exist. '
  - 'Ginevra: Hundreds of subjects got imprisoned here for experiments on DNA or
    some shit, or maybe it was just some arena for rich boasting rats to watch people
    getting butchered for fun.'
  - 'Maia: You one of ''em? '
  - 'Ginevra: Kind of... but i''m not here to have a tea talk with you, get lost
    now.'
  - "Maia: You cannot survive in this place alone.\n\n "
  - 'Ginevra: And why is it your concern? '
  - 'Maia: Nothing damn it , it''s weird to me that you don''t care.'
  - 'Ginevra: I''m not going to help you.'
  - 'Maya: Look I''ve got stuff to trade back at my camp if yo...'
  - 'Ginevra: (Interrupts again)

    Camp you say? You''re alone?'
  - 'Maia: Not exactly...'
  - 'Ginevra: How many?'
  - 'Maia: Just me and a guy that helped me when I got here. He seems dangerous but
    so far he''s been good to me.'
  - 'Ginevra: (Hesitates)

    If you have scrap metal I''ll come.'
  - 'Maia: I do.'
  - 'Ginevra: (Picks up some items on a near counter and puts them in her backpack)

    I''m
    ready, we can go. '
  textSpeed: 0.05
  skipCooldown: 0.2
  rb: {fileID: 677884562}
  playOnce: 1
  fadeImage: {fileID: 1204393528}
  fadeDuration: 2
  delayBeforeQuit: 0.5
